  "title": "The Odyssey",
  "date": "2026-08-12T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "The Odyssey\n\nposter\n\nFirst of all, I do not have so many knowladge about the Odyssey. However, it is a good movie, very CHristopher Nolan style.\n\nFrom my point view is like, Odysseus compainioned with his comrades to invade a country, which is against so called \"Zeus Law\". And then on the way back, he hope others can treat him with the \"Zeus Law\". Of course, they did not. At the same time, his own country got backfired as there is too long time for the king, Odysseus left.\n\nMany people compared this with The journey to the west(西游记). Well, after watching the movie. I think they are talking two different things. The Odyssey is certainly about a topic in Chinese called \"礼坏乐崩\". Old rules are desprecated, new rules are waiting to be formed.\n\nBefore watching this movie, I thought it would be a story of going home.\nAs I am also on the way home of my abroad study. I would like to get some spark from it.\nHowever, since it is talking about \"礼坏乐崩\".\nMore like the thinking about how this new AI era will be formed.",
